# CI and dependency security

A new override floor stays inside one major. The LEGACY_UNBOUNDED list in scripts/security/check-override-floors.mjs may only shrink. Do not add an unbounded floor. Every ignoreGhsas id needs a matching audit-exceptions.json record with an expiry. Do not ignore a withdrawn advisory, and do not remove an ignore while the scanner still reports that advisory.

Do not override a package to a version that is not published. Do not take a major bump without a compatibility proof. The required merge check is CI Status. Do not merge with --admin. A release or a tag needs an explicit owner decision.
